# Trivy Ignore Rules

# SNS topic encryption requires AWS KMS Customer Managed Keys (CMK), which incur base fees ($1/key/month).
# Intentionally suppressed for cost optimization on serverless ingestion pipeline.
AVD-AWS-0095

# S3 customer managed KMS key requirement.
# SSE-S3 (AES256) is explicitly enabled on the bucket at zero cost.
AVD-AWS-0132

# Unrestricted outbound egress (0.0.0.0/0).
# The extractor is an RSS feed crawler requiring public internet access (ports 80, 443, 53)
# to fetch dynamic external feeds and resolve DNS. Inbound ingress remains fully blocked.
AVD-AWS-0104
